WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.680
After Han Xin joined Liu Bang, he was given only a minor post; disappointed, he decided to leave the army.

00:00:07.680 --> 00:00:15.312
Deep in the night, Xiao He heard the news and was alarmed: how could such a talent be allowed to leave?

00:00:15.312 --> 00:00:20.544
The moon rose, and Xiao He rode through the night to catch up with Han Xin.

00:00:20.544 --> 00:00:27.432
Xiao He caught up with Han Xin and earnestly asked him to return: Liu Bang will surely put you in an important position!

00:00:27.432 --> 00:00:33.336
Before dawn, the two rode back together to the Han army camp.

00:00:33.336 --> 00:00:41.184
Xiao He strongly recommended Han Xin to Liu Bang, and Liu Bang made him Grand General, in command of the whole army.

00:00:41.184 --> 00:00:47.616
From then on, Han Xin led the Han army and won great merit in the Chu–Han war.

